(22206: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: parity%2Fgrammars%2Fnative%2Fregex.lino%20is%20a%20canonical%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammar%20that%20js%2Fscripts%2Fimport-native-grammars.mjs%20imports%20from%20the%20pinned%20src%2Fgrammar.json%20of%20tree-sitter-regex%200.25.0%2C%20with%20every%20rule%20renamed%20to%20its%20English%20name%20and%20its%20concept%20merged%20into%20the%20shared%20concepts%2C%20and%20every%20hand%20decision%20recorded%20in%20parity%2Fgrammars%2Fmerge-reports%2Fregex.json.%20Both%20executors%20build%2C%20for%20every%20source%20of%20the%20upstream%20test%2Fcorpus%20and%20for%20hand-written%20sources%2C%20exactly%20the%20concrete%20syntax%20tree%20rows%20of%20the%20tree-sitter-regex%20oracle%20with%20no%20ambiguity%3A%20alternations%20and%20empty%20terms%2C%20pattern%20characters%20and%20the%20any%20character%2C%20line%20start%2C%20line%20end%20and%20word%20boundary%20assertions%2C%20lookahead%20and%20lookbehind%20assertions%2C%20character%20classes%20with%20ranges%2C%20escapes%20and%20POSIX%20classes%2C%20anonymous%2C%20named%20and%20non-capturing%20groups%2C%20inline%20flags%20groups%2C%20greedy%20and%20lazy%20zero%20or%20more%2C%20one%20or%20more%2C%20optional%20and%20count%20quantifiers%2C%20decimal%2C%20character%20class%2C%20control%2C%20unicode%20and%20identity%20escapes%2C%20unicode%20property%20value%20expressions%20and%20backreferences%20included%3B%20a%20brace%20or%20a%20bracket%20that%20opens%20no%20quantifier%20or%20POSIX%20class%20is%20a%20character%2C%20as%20ECMA-262%20Annex%20B.1.2%20reads%20it.%20Both%20executors%20reject%20invalid%20input%20the%20oracle%20recovers%20from%20and%20keep%20every%20source%20byte%2C%20line%20breaks%20included%2C%20in%20the%20tree.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
